menu "LED Blink Configuration"

    config LED_GPIO
        int "LED GPIO number"
        default 48
        range 0 48
        help
            GPIO pin number for the on-board WS2812 LED.
            Default is 48 for ESP32-S3 DevKitC.

    config BLINK_INTERVAL_MS
        int "Blink interval in milliseconds"
        default 500
        range 50 5000
        help
            Half-period for LED blinking. 500 ms produces 1 Hz blink.

endmenu
